{
  "id": 8834816377031,
  "title": "Personalized Wildlife Deer Couple Touching Noses Comforter with Buck",
  "handle": "personalized-wildlife-deer-couple-touching-noses-comforter-with-buck-af760d7fee-af760d7fee",
  "body_html": "<p>Wrap yourself in cozy warmth and love with the personalized deer couple bedding set by Jeminise. Featuring a romantic wildlife design, this quilt set is the perfect addition to your rustic home decor, or a thoughtful gift for birthdays, Valentine's Day, and holidays.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Features a customizable text area to add names, messages, or custom quotes to make this bedding uniquely yours.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Comfort:</strong> Made from a soft, breathable, and durable blend of 70% cotton and 30% polyester with high-quality silk floss filling for year-round warmth.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfectly suited as a cozy bed quilt, a relaxing sofa throw, an outdoor camping blanket, or a scenic picnic mat.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water and quick-drying to maintain its plush softness and vibrant colors.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Optional Accessories:</strong> Available in multiple sizes with the option to include matching decorative pillowcases.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>70% Cotton, 30% Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Silk Floss</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Animal Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Hunting, Wildlife</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
